        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS PLEASE FOLLOW US ON FACEBOOK AND INSTAGRAM AS PROPERTIES ARE ADVERTISED THERE FIRST VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST\nONE BEDROOM / ONE BATHROOM STUDIO\nCASTLE LAWNS, TALLAGHT\nBILLS INCLUDED AVAILABLE NOW\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS are delighted to present this superb one-bedroom, one-bathroom studio to the rental market in the highly sought-after Castle Lawns development, Tallaght, Dublin 24.\nThis bright and well-presented studio offers comfortable living accommodation throughout and benefits from BILLS INCLUDED, making this an ideal hassle-free rental opportunity.\nThe property is ideally located close to a host of local amenities including shops, cafés, restaurants, schools, parks and leisure facilities. Tallaght Village and The Square Shopping Centre are also within easy reach.\nThe property benefits from excellent transport links, including the Red Luas Line and Dublin Bus routes, while the N7 and M50 motorway network are easily accessible, making this an ideal location for commuters.\nInternal accommodation comprises a bright and comfortable living/sleeping area, fitted kitchen facilities and a bathroom.\nBILLS INCLUDED and AVAILABLE NOW. Viewing is highly advised.\nFeatures:\n<ul>\n <li>1 bedroom / 1 bathroom studio</li>\n <li>Fitted kitchen facilities</li>\n <li>BILLS INCLUDED</li>\n <li>Located in Castle Lawns, Tallaght</li>\n <li>Close to Tallaght Village</li>\n <li>Close to The Square Shopping Centre</li>\n <li>Excellent public transport links</li>\n <li>Red Luas Line nearby</li>\n <li>Easy access to N7 & M50 motorways</li>\n <li>A host of local amenities nearby</li>\n <li>AVAILABLE NOW!!</li>\n</ul>\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS EMAIL ENQUIRY ONLY/NO PHONE CALLS PLEASE FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION AND WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE"
